{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792771946,"nonce":"DE/2UvruZvCU4AIugErB6hf5TBY=","title":"Move external class paths into Dependencies and preview their files","message":"An ashui project exposes ../ash/haxelib/ash-future beneath the main Explorer tree. Opening that dependency README in Markdown preview fails with \"That is outside the project.\" and leaves a permanent Loading preview state. External class paths belong in Dependencies, alongside resolved libraries, with consistent file icons. Preview reads and source navigation must accept declared dependency roots while extension writes remain workspace-only. Refusals should identify the requested path and workspace, and failed previews need a retryable inline error.","files":null}]}